    <gnodes xsi:type="com.gebautomation.graphmodel:Annotation" position="60;360" size="745;97" localId="193" comment="To test this: &#xD;&#xA;Run in the simulator (Run -> Debug As -> IEC 61131), with cycles=0 (infinite loop), 200msecs per cycle.&#xD;&#xA;Emulate a car that goes towards the outdoor by writing the I/O variables (left pane) in the following order:&#xD;&#xA;1. set IX54.2  (inner barrier, turns red)&#xD;&#xA;2. set  IX54.1 (outer barrier, turns red)&#xD;&#xA;You should see (both in the diagram and in the digital output %QX55.1) that the output light activates during 5 seconds.&#xD;&#xA;&#xD;&#xA;"/>
  </body>
